i": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593718973_27416571294663220_8624521292587828499_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FkyLPKySr7sQ7kNvwFOpdst&_nc_oc=AdoM_6goD3uWqMANPYj7sjL8ldEXx0BrjN9q2NeEx5J6dOO3Z5rEdRe_xSWUwBZiLBU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR-eNhXCUdGzmXmSr8wLkm1WATW8z-RrehPGsgbOo65ag&oe=6B0845F1"}, {"file_name": "Final_Screenshot_2.png", "id": "4477904262492441", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294711_4477904265825774_1177476869877157488_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BWgnDUdAoj4Q7kNvwHwFviR&_nc_oc=AdoSqVqUGNHnGahA0-IKMZL3OlQxni76bNfWTRsiQcK8kWd0eE5R1wnwROxukr1KXRY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSU6kl60cgpf1d8gerqr9epjspJJB4S-zkmLtgB-Vd5tw&oe=6B085D37"}, {"file_name": "Final_Screenshot_3.png", "id": "2914157152258778", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299051_2914157155592111_621753286385509017_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3WYalzn5xVcQ7kNvwGUl0QB&_nc_oc=AdqZJ9LnILkAft-yLHJ-OEM_uBECEE1UK-GyL9cz1LpMdwHonpIJ3G-Zl0uPjknfBjI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRzsTeKKmfhZUE2mep7SZWEt55iQOpa9PRAX4Y745en-w&oe=6B084B9D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Final_Cover.png", "id": "1309957561308145", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314667_1309957564641478_7151845419715110063_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aiMhnqg8S2UQ7kNvwEImVDA&_nc_oc=AdpfFHA244I25-fPXtp1tdPUDVrGHmiTF6ghIuPEfeyMauufzdIu_FwpNXVEm-PTSxo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR13KaD5u-6gfhwRwq8h40q-euXf56yqeg2uJMvPfBq3Q&oe=6B0868C1"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": ["Racing", "Multiplayer", "Motorcycle", "Cyberpunk", "Tron"], "long_description": "# **Race, slash, and survive on the electro grid \u2014 FREE to play! \u26a1**\n\nHard Drive is a neon-lit multiplayer light trail combat game built for VR. Pilot a sleek electro byke, carve trails of light across the grid, and force your rivals into a corner they can't escape. One wrong move and it's over \u2014 for them or for you.\n\nFast reflexes. Split-second decisions. Pure electro chaos.\n\n# \u26a1 What's on the Grid\n\n**\ud83c\udfcd\ufe0f Byke Combat**\n- **Bike Battle Arena** \u2014 classic light trail combat, last cycle standing wins\n- **Non-PvP Driving Park** \u2014 practice your lines, master your byke, no pressure\n- **Explorable Island** \u2014 venture beyond the arena and see what the grid holds\n\n**\ud83d\udcbf Disk Combat**\n- **Disk Battle Arena** \u2014 ditch the byke, throw disks, eliminate your opponents\n- **Disk & Bike Battle Arena** \u2014 both disciplines collide in one chaotic mode\n\n**\ud83c\udfc6 Progression & Rewards**\n- **Season Pass** with exclusive progression rewards\n- **Cosmetic Shop** to customize your byke and rider\n- More content dropping soon \u2014 the grid keeps expanding\n\n# The Grid is Live. Can You Handle It? \u26a1", "short_description": "Race, slash, and survive on the electro grid \u2014 FREE to play! \u26a1\n\nHard Drive is a neon-lit, multiplayer light trail combat game built for VR. \n\nCut off rivals with your trail, dodge incoming lines, and be the last cycle standing on the grid. Fast reflexes, split-second decisions, pure electro combat chaos.\n\nThe grid is live. Can you handle it?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mystical-mote-389916.web.app/harddrive/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Red Team Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mystical-mote-389916.web.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "G